      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784057968745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- divide time into fixed windows(1-minute buckets) and count requests in each window\n- Maintain a counter for each user, that resets to zero at start of each new window, if counter exceeds, reject new requests until window resets.\n- Its a hash map mapping clientIDs to (counter, window_start_time) pair.\nProblem : Boundary Effect - user make 100 requests at 12:00:59 then makes another 100 at 12:01 getting 200 requests in 2 seconds\npotential starvation of user if they hit limit early in a window",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- divide time into fixed windows(1-minute buckets) and count requests in each window\n- Maintain a counter for each user, that resets to zero at start of each new window, if counter exceeds, reject new requests until window resets.\n- Its a hash map mapping clientIDs to (counter, window_start_time) pair.\nProblem : Boundary Effect - user make 100 requests at 12:00:59 then makes another 100 at 12:01 getting 200 requests in 2 seconds\npotential starvation of user if they hit limit early in a window",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
